{
  "title": "Delete the Postgres importer once prod runs on SQLite",
  "description": "`ramekin-server import-postgres` (server/src/import_postgres.rs, the `postgres` crate in server/Cargo.toml) exists only to move prod's data from Postgres to SQLite once (doc/sqlite-cutover.md). \
After the cutover, delete the module, its dispatch in main.rs, the `postgres` dependency, and the cutover runbook's import steps (keep its backup section, or move it to DEVELOPMENT.md). \
Also drop the leftover Postgres wording that only made sense during the move (e.g. the data_migrations.rs note about migrations that ran on Postgres can stay).",
